> stri_count_fixed(test1, "00", overlap=TRUE)
[1] 2

> stri_count_fixed(test1, "11", overlap=TRUE)
[1] 8

This isn’t obvious in the help for stri_count_fixed, because overlap=TRUE is an argument to stri_opts_fixed(), which is passed on through the ... argument. See ?stri_opts_fixed. You can also set case_insensitive this way.
​

